event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_009874c36b45d8b4016ad3d65d5bb087d2a0876c87c191f136","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":210,"text":"Implemented three minimal fixes:\n- `src/csv.mjs`: commits pending EOF records without adding phantom records after final newlines.\n- `src/money.mjs`: uses exact `BigInt` decimal arithmetic for half-away-from-zero rounding, preserving format and safe-integer validation.\n- `src/dedupe.mjs`: uses a collision-safe vendor/invoice tuple key, shared by deduplication and payment routing.\n\nValidation:\n- Baseline `node --test test/*.test.mjs`: **38 passed, 6 failed**.\n- After fixes, same command: **44 passed, 0 failed**, including mixed-feed import and supplier-specific reconciliation tests.\n\nI attempted the requested reconciliation CLI command, but the execution harness blocked it because only test commands are permitted. Thus I could not inspect its real output. The CLI subprocess acceptance test did pass, confirming all four invoices import with a USD total of **1,208 cents**.\n\nOnly the three source files above were changed; immutable acceptance material was untouched."}

